# Product specification rules

- `docs/prds/` holds full product requirement documents; use `_template.md` for new PRDs.
- `openspec/specs/` contains current durable requirement contracts. `openspec/changes/` contains only the delta needed to implement a proposed change.
- Link the PRD from every proposal rather than duplicating it.
- Capture user flow, all visible states, accessibility, measurement, non-goals, public component contract, and consuming-app impact.
- A PRD is implementation-ready only when acceptance criteria are observable and open questions are explicit.
